你们。”她这样一称呼，不禁将目光吸引来。宝丽如获珍宝：“对啊，咱们如玉还是季二少奶奶呢。”马上蛊惑她：“快给季二少打电话，季少来不了，有二少请客也好啊。”颜如玉看了顾浅凝一眼，做出为难的样子：“那好吧，我试试，十有八九来不了。”拿出电话给季江然打过去，状况明显比顾浅凝可喜很多。只简单说了两句，就听颜如玉说：“那好，在帝宫门口碰头，开车小心。”挂断电话，大家一阵欢呼，直嚷着颜如玉有本事。顾浅凝心里并没多少不自在，她不是真的顾浅凝，这种小计量实在打击不到她。颜如玉先去洗手间补妆，几个人到外面等她。等赶到帝宫的时候，季江然已经到了。风度翩翩的公子哥，站在帝宫那片璀璨的灯火里，仍旧眉眼生辉。颜如玉快旁人几步，已经先朝他飞奔过去。季江然就这样好，不论真欢还是假爱，场面戏做得足。一伸手将颜如玉揽到怀里，问她：“约朋友一起吃饭怎么不早说，我直接请了多方便。”颜如玉温存说；“之前没想到让男同志加入，突发其想，想找个人来买单，就给你打电话了。”季江然眉舒目展：“找我算找对人了。”抬眸望向走近的几人，目光在顾浅凝的脸上流连一圈。仿佛说笑：“呦，嫂子也在这里，让我们怎么放得开胡闹。”是了，人前他要尊称她一声“嫂子”的。顾浅凝笑了声：“既然叫我嫂子，都是弟弟妹妹，以前胡闹就算了，以后乖一点儿就好了。”季江然眼眸骤然变深。颜如玉的电话突然响起来，她一边接起来一边跟大家伙说：“我之前在车上给子析打了一个电话，把她也叫上了，人多更好玩。”然后问：“子析，快到了么？”安子析似是说等一会儿，就听颜如玉说不急，接着又说；“要带家属？那当然好，正愁人少热不起场子呢。”挂掉电话对几人说；“安子析一会儿过来，说还要带家属来。”便有人揣测：“她交男朋友了？”几个女人七嘴八舌。顾浅凝站在一边面无表情，抬腕看时间，打算再熬半小时就借口离开。一抬眸，季江然正若有所思的盯紧她。季二少出手阔绰，酒水饮料可劲点，哪一瓶红酒都价值不斐，食品也摆了一满桌。几个女人很热切。顾浅凝对这种事情很无感，进到包间后挑了最边缘的沙发入座。她以前没什么朋友，最熟悉的就是一个小组的战友，平时也是厮杀得你死我活，谁都想做那个不被淘汰的强者。有的时候也羡慕平常人的生活，休息日可以跟三两个好友聚在一起聊天。但顾浅凝这样的生活，真的很难让人羡慕得起来，随处可见的虚情假意，一双双的媚眼如斯都仿佛是带着毒的。身侧的沙发陷下一点儿，转首，季江然将盛满酒的杯子塞到她手里。浅浅饮了一口，转首看她：“怎么？不开心？”顾浅凝笑了：“季二少请客，怎么会不开心。”说着，仰首喝掉半杯。季江然提醒她：“想醉死？”顾浅凝抬起杯子看了看，就这样的酒会醉得死人？好笑：“季二少以为我是纸糊的。”颜如玉看到两人在说话，坐过来，拉起季江然的胳膊：“和嫂子说什么呢？”季江然笑笑；“给大嫂倒了杯酒。”颜如玉笑起来：“这样一叫还真不舒服呢，平时我和浅凝都是好朋友，现在却要叫她大嫂。”顾浅凝平声道：“都叫我浅凝吧，我和季大少的事还都说不准。”颜如玉白了她一眼；“你就装吧，当时可是逼着我们叫你大嫂呢，说你就是季大少的人了。”季浅凝只是笑；“你就当以前的顾浅凝大脑被驴踢了，我不介意。”安子析来的很快，一同进门来的人更是让人心惊。竟然是日理万机，推说自己脱不开身的季江影。在场的人都要看向顾浅凝。顾浅凝双腿交叠，坦然的坐在那里，颌首望过去。心中讪笑，看笑话不正是大家梦寐以求的，何必做出这种怜悯又好笑的神色。早听说顾浅凝在上流社会是没有多少地位的，最大的成就就是做了季江影的未婚妻，被人虎视眈眈。前段时间的一场事故，彻底成了上流社会的笑柄，都知道花瓶一般的顾浅凝不过就是一个摆设。现在种种迹象看来，竟是真的，不知多么大快人心呢。季江影和安子析一进来，就像按了静音键。顺着众人的目光望过去，看到端坐在那里的顾浅凝。做惊悚的小白兔，强装受害人：“原来顾小姐也在这里，江影本来不想过来，我看他工作忙完了，就硬拉他过来了。”倒是季江影，神色从容，倜傥风流，半点儿不适感都没有。有人猜顾浅凝会发疯，谩骂或者撕打都有可能，她就是个有娘生没娘养的疯丫头。顾浅凝没理安子析，只看向季江影，一扯唇角笑了：“季大少，好久不见。没吃晚饭吧，正好过来吃点儿东西吧。”颜如玉马上招呼季江影和安子析过去坐，把中间一大块地方让给他们。安娜已经开始唱歌。顾浅凝很平静的喝了两杯酒。感到季江然时不时看过来。转首与他对视，淡淡说：“季二少，信不信我把你两只眼睛挖出来？”季江然“噗嗤”一声爽朗的笑起来。颜如玉不明所以，问他：“江然，你笑什么？”安娜捧着脸：“是不是我唱歌跑调了？”顾浅凝仰首将杯中**一饮而尽，站起身随口说：“第二段的确走音走的厉害。”然后扫了众人一眼：“生物钟到了，先回去睡了，你们玩的尽兴。”季江然颌首，意味别样：“变早了？”颜如玉过来拉她；“先别走啊，人才聚全，就多玩一会儿吧，现在也不到你睡眠的时间。”安子析又在那里冲大尾巴狼。“是不是因为我过来了？那我先走吧。”顾浅凝看过来；“你跟我能扯上关系么？你是顾家人？我是安家人？还是我们在一个公司争权夺利？季大少么？”雍容一笑，明艳不可方物：“那你可真是想多了，不要说季大少跟我没什么关系，就算有关系，我未必真会将你看在眼中。”一句话，辛辣干脆。安子析一时脸面上挂不住，明显有些僵了。季江然兴味盎然，眼风探向季江影，见他眸子眯紧，深邃的盯紧顾浅凝。没说站出来维护谁，安子析不能跟顾浅凝撕破脸，识趣坐下还赚个识大体。顾浅凝要走了。还是被宝丽拉上：“浅凝，你平时这个时间也不睡，以前玩通宵都常有的事，我们要玩牌，一起。”顾浅凝决意要走，看到安娜手里的牌，忽而来了一点儿兴致。将牌拿在手中，颌首问季江影：“季大少，要不要赌一把？”季江影没想过会有人跟他叫板。飘飘问：“赌什么？”顾浅凝坐过来，将字子析顺理成章隔到一边去。“按理说我对季大少是没什么所求，但是你身边别有用心之人实在太多，时不时就要给我添堵。所以如果我赢了，就请季大少携如花美眷们离我远一点儿？”季江影好整以暇：“有多远？”他穿了件黑色硬领衬衣，本来极度沉默，奈何气质干净儒雅，倒显得面如冠玉。眼眸明亮如星，笑意不达眼底。顾浅凝心口有一点儿紧，确定是顾浅凝原神的意念所致。垂下眸子：“至少要让我清净省心。”季江影从她手中将牌拿过去，手指白皙修长，指腹冰冷，按在她的掌心上。凉凉说：“其他人可以，但是你知道我肯定是不可能。”不带任何感情的提醒她；“你是我的未婚妻。”然后问她：“怎么赌？”顾浅凝很干净：“抽出一副牌随你洗，如果我能从中抽出两个黑字A，就算我赢了。”“好。”季江影动作行云流水，十指玩弄得纸牌唰唰作响。眨眼放她面前：“可以了，抽吧。”顾浅凝屏气凝神，集中注意力盯紧一沓纸牌。整个包间的氛围都跟着紧张起来，个个大气不敢喘。只见顾浅凝斟酌须臾，顺手抽出两张。看了一眼，微笑，接着甩到茶几上。拿上包起身走人。将话语抛给他：“季大少，记得看好你身边的闲杂人等。”平白被折腾大半夜，什么兴致都没有了。回到家里还不到睡觉的时间，洗澡后去床上看片子。顾浅凝的生活是很好的，只是没想到这栋别墅是季江然的。不过她不打算现在就还给他，回去跟顾家人一起住，相信撑不了几天就要露洞百出，而且她没有跟陌生人生活在一个屋檐下的习惯。但是，依顾浅凝现在的经济实力，只是零花钱充足，要想购置一栋房产，简直九牛一毛。她还要另想办法。要睡下的时候，卧室门打开，她警觉得一下醒来，判断来人之后几乎要哀呼出声。季江然已经走过来，从身后揽住她。“想不想我？”顾浅凝一伸手按开床头灯，转身看着他：“看你未婚妻那个鬼样子，我真想一口口吞了你。不过一想到你是季家人，又让人倒尽胃口。”", "source": "www.quanwenyuedu.io", "source_url": "https://www.quanwenyuedu.io/n/chongshengzhihaomenhannu/5.html", "_fixed": true, "content_en": "The First Class in the Spring Breeze (005) We took a gamble and met each other, but we didn't feel familiar. Just like two strange women, they can only decide which one is called Baoli and which one is called Anna according to the situation. They are all fashionably dressed women. Seeing Gu Qianning praising her for becoming more beautiful, he asked some questions about her physical condition and sat down to talk. A few people had eaten and were about to go singing. Yan Ruyu was generous: \"Go to the imperial palace to sing, and I will pay for everything tonight.\" Anna clapped her hands and applauded: \"Ah, Ruyu is too generous.\" Baoli disagreed: \"Ruyu can't please, what's the point of asking several sisters?\" Looking at Gu Qianning: \"Aren't we Qianning's fiancées now? Ask Qianning to call Young Master Ji. He should be the one to invite us. We can be considered Qianning's natal family after all.\" Ma: \"Let Ji Jiangying invite him. He doesn't have time. I'll invite him tonight.\" Baoli disagreed: \"How about that? Just give him a call and try. If you're really busy and can't come, then let's talk about it.\" Anna also said, \"Yes, it's evening now. No matter how busy you are, you should rest.\" Yan Ruyu looked over and said, \"Qian Ning, let's give it a try.\" Gu Qian Ning had no choice but to ask for trouble even though he knew what the result would be. After the phone rang a few times and she picked it up, she opened her mouth and said, \"Jiang Ying, do you have time now? My friend wants to see you.\" The other end sneered: \"Gu Qianning, is your head okay?\" Gu Qianning expected this to be the case. It's not that she didn't see whether he was busy or not, it was just embarrassing himself. He picked up the phone and said, \"He's working overtime and doesn't have time.\" Several people looked at each other and almost smiled. Yan Ruyu seemed to be trying to smooth things over with good intentions: \"Brother is really busy. It's true that I can't find time to work overtime at night. This Qian Ning didn't lie to you.\" She couldn't help but attract attention when she called him this. Baoli felt as if she had found a treasure: \"Yes, our Ruyu is still the Second Young Master Ji.\" She immediately bewitched her: \"Hurry up and call the Second Young Master Ji, Master Ji can't come, it's better to have the Second Young Master to treat us.\" Yan Ruyu glanced at Gu Qianning and made an embarrassed look: \"Okay, I'll try, there's a good chance that I won't come.\" She took out the phone and called Ji Jiangran. The situation was obviously much better than that of Gu Qianning. After just a few words, Yan Ruyu said, \"Okay, let's meet at the entrance of the Imperial Palace, and drive carefully.\" After hanging up the phone, everyone cheered, shouting that Yan Ruyu was capable. Gu Qianning didn't feel much uncomfortable in her heart. She wasn't really Gu Qianning, and this small measure couldn't really hurt her. Yan Ruyu went to the bathroom to touch up her makeup first, while several people waited for her outside. By the time they arrived at the imperial palace, Ji Jiangran had already arrived. The elegant young master stood in the bright lights of the Imperial Palace, his eyebrows still shining. Yan Ruyu was a few steps ahead of the others and was already running towards him first. Ji Jiangran is so good, whether it's true love or fake love, he does enough scenes. He stretched out his hand to take Yan Ruyu into his arms and asked her, \"Why didn't you tell me earlier that you were going to have dinner with a friend? How convenient is it that I invited you directly.\" Yan Ruyu said gently, \"I didn't think of letting gay men join in before, but I suddenly thought that I wanted to find someone to pay for it, so I called you.\" Ji Jiangran's eyes widened: \"I'm the right person.\" He raised his eyes to look at the people approaching, his eyes lingering on Gu Qianning's face. It was as if he was joking: \"Hey, my sister-in-law is here too, so let's have some fun.\" Yes, he would address her as \"sister-in-law\" in front of others. Gu Qianning laughed: \"Since you call me sister-in-law, we are both younger brothers and sisters. Let's forget about the mischief in the past. Just be a little better in the future.\" Ji Jiangran's eyes suddenly darkened. Yan Ruyu's phone suddenly rang. She picked it up and said to everyone: \"I called Zixi in the car before and called her on. It's more fun when there are more people.\" Then she asked: \"Zixi, are you almost there?\" An Zixi seemed to say wait a while, and then heard Yan Ruyu's phone call. Ruyu said there was no rush, and then added, \"You want to bring your family members? That's great, but I'm worried that there are not many people and we can't afford the venue.\" She hung up the phone and said to a few people, \"An Zixi will come over in a while and said he wants to bring his family members.\" Some people speculated: \"She has a boyfriend?\" Several women talked about it. Gu Qianning stood aside with an expressionless face, raising her wrist to look at the time, planning to stay up for another half an hour before making an excuse to leave. When he raised his eyes, Ji Jiangran was staring at her thoughtfully. Second Young Master Ji spent a lot of money, the drinks were generous, every bottle of red wine was valuable, and the table was full of food. Several women were eager. Gu Qianning was indifferent to this kind of thing. After entering the private room, she chose the sofa at the edge and sat down. She didn't have many friends before. The ones she was most familiar with were her comrades in a group, and they usually fought to the death. Everyone wanted to be the strong one who wouldn't be eliminated. Sometimes I envy the life of ordinary people, where I can get together with three or two friends to chat on my days off. But Gu Qianning's life is really hard to envy. Hypocrisy can be seen everywhere, and her charming eyes seem to be poisonous. The sofa beside her sank a little. Turning her head, Ji Jiangran thrust the glass full of wine into her hand. He took a small sip and turned to look at her: \"What? Not happy?\" Gu Qianning smiled: \"Second Young Master Ji is treating us, how could he not be happy?\" After saying that, he raised his head and drank half the glass. Ji Jiangran reminded her: \"Want to get drunk to death?\" Gu Qianning raised the cup and looked at it. Would such a drink make people drunk to death? Funny: \"Second Young Master Ji thought I was made of paper.\" Yan Ruyu saw the two of them talking, sat over and took Ji Jiangran's arm: \"What are you talking about with sister-in-law?\" Ji Jiangran smiled; \"I poured a glass of wine for sister-in-law.\" Yan Ruyu laughed: \"It's really uncomfortable to be called like that. Qian Ning and I are usually good friends, but now I want to call her sister-in-law. \"Gu Qian Ning said calmly: \"You can call me Qian Ning, we are still not sure about the matter between Master Ji and me.\" Yan Ruyu rolled her eyes at her; \"You just pretended to be her sister-in-law. At that time, she forced us to call you sister-in-law.", "title_en": "Chapter 5"}